window.READER_CONTENT["d31480e42d8e2efdf"]={"html": "<h1 id=\"test-461-quest统计表独立复算与hol候选诊断\">TEST-461 QUEST统计表独立复算与HOL候选诊断</h1>\n<p>实际collect exit0，30条件/405000完整/360000统计/90流；完整命令results README，输出quest-closure-results/evidence/main-01。实际独立verify_delivery exit0，APP原始90流/30条件/五组表/42条件比较/126逐UE比较，以及seed两接入均值→三seed中位、正负号、Markdown显示表均相同；main-delivery-check-01.json含所有交付SHA，脚本SHA d0fc8c60a6fd024f0866afc2b507609fc23643e975e0d15010f163c01d060e97。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">cd /home/lbh/oiwireless/oi-wireless-ran-quest-closure\ntaskset -c 2 /usr/bin/python3 -B research/latency-analysis/quest-closure-results/collect.py --root /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/quest-closure-20261029/main-01 --independent /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/quest-closure-20261029/main-independent-01.json --environment /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/quest-closure-20261029/environment-after-main-01.json --output research/latency-analysis/quest-closure-results/evidence/main-01\ntaskset -c 2 /usr/bin/python3 -B research/latency-analysis/quest-closure-results/verify_delivery.py --root /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/quest-closure-20261029/main-01 --evidence research/latency-analysis/quest-closure-results/evidence/main-01 --output /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/quest-closure-20261029/main-delivery-check-01.json\ntaskset -c 2 /usr/bin/python3 -B research/latency-analysis/quest-closure-results/rank_diagnostics.py --root /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/quest-closure-20261029/main-01 --output research/latency-analysis/quest-closure-results/evidence/rank-01\n</code></pre>\n<p>rank首次exit1仅因父evidence目录未创建，尚未读数据、目标目录不存在；修mkdir parents后exit0，原目标未覆盖数据。原始QUEST6条件实际权重重算与trace一致；9对9的16805次全在无HOL并列，HOL打破16778；69对9 26595次没有严格逆序。是候选内代数诊断，不是新业务反事实/时延贡献比例，完整范围rank报告/CHG316。</p>\n<p>正式主要结论：QUEST/PF的69降幅10.433646%（6/6），整体最差反增3.420130%（只1/6改善）；QUEST/noHOL对最差9与整体最差降9.638952%（6/6），69仅0.251103%且2/6改善。QUEST相对M-LWDF整体最差恶化3.564800%（仅1/6改善）；EDF差异方向不一致，不能宣称QUEST压倒强基线。数值层次/局限见summary及docs19。统计不是RTT/PDB合规/P99.9可靠性，不同root不混池。协议/论文/<a class=\"citation\" href=\"#/paper/book\" title=\"打开本地教材\">教材</a>实际定位见方法README/CHG317。没有新RAN实验或新缺件，Git取消/Office未改。</p>\n", "toc": [{"id": "test-461-quest统计表独立复算与hol候选诊断", "title": "TEST-461 QUEST统计表独立复算与HOL候选诊断", "level": 1}]};